{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 66, :comments ["<b>תלאים</b> — twice in the Masorah: והיו חייך תלואים, ועמי תלואים למשובתי. And this is what we say: the בינונים are suspended and standing between Rosh HaShanah and Yom HaKippurim — if they merit, they are written for life; if they do not merit, they are written for death. And this is ועמי תלואים — they are suspended and standing until they do repentance."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:58.015468453Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}